    <description>UiPath.DocumentUnderstanding.ML Activities

Activity package that enable Machine Learning Document Understanding features, such as the Machine Learning Extractor and the Machine Learning Classifier.

This package requires a UiPath Studio and Robot version 2019.10 or above, and access to AI Fabric, for using custom ML models through ML Skills.</description>
